  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social franchising project for establishing the employment system for persons with disabilities in the philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing business model for Hisbeans cafe philippines, Expansion of direct employment for persons with disabilities or in vulnerable social group, Strengthening solidarity of local community and mutual confidence&#xD544;&#xB9AC;&#xD540; &#xB9C8;&#xB2D0;&#xB77C; &#xB0B4; &#xC7A5;&#xC560;&#xC778; &#xBC0F; &#xCDE8;&#xC57D;&#xACC4;&#xCE35; &#xC9C1;&#xC811;&#xACE0;&#xC6A9; &#xD655;&#xB300;&#xB97C; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xCE74;&#xD398;&#xC6B4;&#xC601; &#xBC0F; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xC5F0;&#xB300; &#xBC0F; &#xC2E0;&#xB8B0;&#xAD6C;&#xCD95;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vitalizaion of the 1st Hisbeans cafe in Philippines, Conducting refresher training for cafe employees, Case management of employees with disabilities or in vulnerable social group, Operating Hisbeans coffee school, Get consulting from  social enterprises or DPO about technology solutions, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
